{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "HealthLens: Integrated Steady-State Axis Framework — Dataset, Evidence Library & Validation Artefacts",
    "subtitle": "Deterministic, jurisdiction-aware wellness fusion engine; eight-axis scoring, evidence database, cross-instrument convergent validity, multi-seed reproducibility and adversarial robustness",
    "publication_date": "2026-10-20",
    "resource_type": "dataset",
    "creators": [
      {
        "name": "Li, Xing",
        "given_name": "Xing",
        "family_name": "Li",
        "affiliation": "HealthLens Open-Source Project",
        "orcid": "0009-0004-2152-7669"
      }
    ],
    "description": "Dataset archive for the HealthLens integrated steady-state axis framework (A–H). Contains:\n\n(1) Evidence database (120 entries): 29 with verified Crossref DOIs, 91 synthetic validation fixtures — evidence coverage 24.2% honestly reported.\n\n(2) Four-way terminology mapping (GB/T 20348-2026 <-> eight axes <-> biological pathways <-> classical Chinese-medicine text fragments, 613 fragments).\n\n(3) Cross-instrument convergent validity bridge — SF-36 PCS/MCS, PHQ-9, PROMIS Sleep T-scores vs the eight HealthLens axes, n=200 latent-shared synthetic profiles, seed 20261018.\n\n(4) Multi-seed reproducibility — 50 seeds x 50 profiles = 2500 scoring calls; deterministic double-run verified at 0 diff.\n\n(5) Adversarial robustness battery — 300 pathological profiles across 7 categories; 0 crashes, 0 out-of-range, 0 NaN/inf.\n\n(6) Reliability bootstrap — 18 profiles x 1000 perturbations, ICC(2,1) and weighted kappa for all eight axes.\n\n(7) PhenoAge alignment benchmark (Liu 2018) — r=0.806, MAE 5.2y, RMSE 7.1y on 200 synthetic profiles with honest device-level calibration caveat.\n\n(8) DECIDE-AI + TRIPOD-AI + SPIRIT-AI checklist self-audit — 52 items, 47 satisfied + 5 partial = 95.2% compliance score.\n\n(9) Prospective cohort protocol, IRB submission package, ethics review statement, data governance, informed consent, participant questionnaire, data dictionary, analysis plan and OSF pre-print draft (SPIRIT-AI aligned).\n\nAll artefacts are deterministic from frozen seeds; the reproducibility tooling is included in the repository. HealthLens is a wellness framework, not a medical device.",
